==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|hated}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hatod}}, {{m|ang|ġehatod|t=hated|pos=past participle}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hatadaz|t=hated}}, equivalent to {{af|en|hate|-ed}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|haated}}, {{m|stq|hoated|t=hated}}, {{cog|nl|gehaat|t=hated}}, {{cog|nds-de|haat|t=hated}}, {{cog|de|gehasst|t=hated}}, {{cog|sv|hatad|t=hated}}, {{cog|is|hataður|t=hated}}.

